{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 35","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> varies directly with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and inversely with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20fce41465f6ac44f0c78fbacabb9cb5e9682f9a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/b/a2b0e1404de4eca35c42876bcc83707b753e990e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/6/5e6dc42bb0d892a136cd56c48b13585b42428825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=2$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/4/8a4808fab877e290bdc0e68ce61cc8a852fd397b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/b/04ba49e85bb40e9b9f5326f02560e691b73ac2ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/1/2f143c262ff121550946d63910889f62fcb48e5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  16 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  24 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  64 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  256 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_35&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> varies directly with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and inversely with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/10153021297e28ba7f33a84140cad83610ddb895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{ky}{z}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"60\" height=\"39\" /> for some constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />. We then have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/1/7a129b736e31797f401d47eac98a18b4f3354073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12 = \\frac{3k}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"67\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/3/5e32b8fc0d456f59e91dd94b52f49606da13959b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 12 \\times \\frac{2}{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"123\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>Thus, when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/f/4ff8bbad79fc034a1b35329acef5492dc937ecd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/359d4caf8f6b3ac51865d6ab1cfbe67aac4585b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/1/f516b88d7de137088df5635a8987b297432892db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{8 \\times 8}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/e/c1ee1763ec8f9ea86c29628847904da03868c0d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2 \\times 8 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"165\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>¬anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 34\">Problem 34</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 36\">Problem 36</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 8\">8</a